00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:03,000
The modern military command post,

2
00:00:03,001 --> 00:00:06,000
a tangle of communications and computers

3
00:00:06,001 --> 00:00:09,000
that gathers intelligence instantly from anywhere on Earth.

4
00:00:09,001 --> 00:00:13,000
From Hannibal to Grant to Eisenhower to Abazid,

5
00:00:13,001 --> 00:00:16,000
military commanders have gathered timely information

6
00:00:16,001 --> 00:00:19,000
in ever more sophisticated command posts.

7
00:00:19,001 --> 00:00:23,000
Now, Command Central on Modern Marvels.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:44,000
On March 19, 2003, coalition troops invaded Iraq, aiming for

9
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:47,660
Saddam Hussein and Baghdad with all of the force and might of

10
00:00:47,661 --> 00:00:52,400
the United States military. The invasion generated a flood of

11
00:00:52,401 --> 00:00:55,840
intelligence from satellite imagery, weapons mounted video

