00:00:59,841 --> 00:01:02,840
ground. All of it was gathered, sorted,

14
00:01:02,841 --> 00:01:06,840
and filtered by United States Central Command, or CENTCOM, a

15
00:01:06,841 --> 00:01:10,840
modern military command post. CENTCOM isn't the entire U.S.

16
00:01:10,841 --> 00:01:13,840
military structure that monitors the world.

17
00:01:13,841 --> 00:01:17,840
It is just one part of that structure, the part that monitors

