00:01:17,841 --> 00:01:22,840
the so-called central region. Other command posts, CENTCOM,

19
00:01:22,841 --> 00:01:26,340
central region. Other command posts similar to

20
00:01:26,341 --> 00:01:29,980
CENTCOM have different responsibilities, including

21
00:01:29,981 --> 00:01:33,800
monitoring other regions of the world or handling specialized

22
00:01:33,801 --> 00:01:38,680
military functions. But all modern command posts are

23
00:01:38,681 --> 00:01:42,140
