24
00:01:42,141 --> 00:01:46,080
CENTCOM is the premier example of the modern command post

25
00:01:46,081 --> 00:01:49,080
because it is enmeshed in the most hostile region on the

26
00:01:49,081 --> 00:01:53,120
The tools it uses to gather and sort information have to be

27
00:01:53,121 --> 00:01:58,160
cutting edge. There is a belt of conflict

