36
00:02:30,441 --> 00:02:34,440
responsibility, or AOR. These two command posts are

37
00:02:34,441 --> 00:02:38,440
tethered by communications equipment, and together they

38
00:02:38,441 --> 00:02:42,440
monitor events in a 25-country swath.

39
00:02:42,441 --> 00:02:45,440
Although CENTCOM was established more than two decades ago,

40
00:02:45,441 --> 00:02:49,140
CENTCOM's forward command post in Doha, Qatar was constructed

41
00:02:49,141 --> 00:02:53,540
in just three months in 2003, after planners felt it was safe

42
00:02:53,541 --> 00:02:57,380
and necessary to have a military presence within the CENTCOM

43
00:02:57,381 --> 00:03:00,080
AOR. You might ask yourself,

44
00:03:00,081 --> 00:03:04,300
is that a workable solution? How can a command have real-time

