00:03:38,341 --> 00:03:42,940
collapsible boxes, and they prepared the area inside a big

54
00:03:42,941 --> 00:03:46,520
hangar-like structure, which was nice because it allowed us

55
00:03:46,521 --> 00:03:51,420
better environmental control. We were connected through

