00:05:31,781 --> 00:05:35,780
conferences, a network of the most sophisticated communications

85
00:05:35,781 --> 00:05:38,780
technology available enables command posts to develop

86
00:05:38,781 --> 00:05:41,780
intelligence into an overwhelming military

87
00:05:41,781 --> 00:05:45,780
advantage. Communications aided by high

88
00:05:45,781 --> 00:05:48,780
technology these days is what we call a force multiplier.

89
00:05:48,781 --> 00:05:51,780
It actually enhances the ability of your force to have any effect

90
00:05:51,781 --> 00:05:54,780
in warfare. The purpose of this secure video

