00:05:57,781 --> 00:06:00,780
central command component commanders...

93
00:06:00,781 --> 00:06:03,780
Modern command posts provide three basic types of

94
00:06:03,781 --> 00:06:06,780
information. First is situational

95
00:06:06,781 --> 00:06:09,780
awareness. We'll provide a general understanding

96
00:06:09,781 --> 00:06:13,780
of what is happening in our area of responsibility, or

97
00:06:13,781 --> 00:06:16,780
more specifically, an understanding of the insurgency

98
00:06:16,781 --> 00:06:20,780
that is ongoing in Iraq, or ongoing al-Qaeda terrorist

99
00:06:20,781 --> 00:06:23,780
