100
00:06:23,781 --> 00:06:26,880
will provide is force protection information.

101
00:06:26,980 --> 00:06:29,880
Essentially, we receive information about threats

102
00:06:29,980 --> 00:06:31,880
or impending attacks upon our forces

103
00:06:31,980 --> 00:06:33,520
in the area of responsibility.

104
00:06:33,620 --> 00:06:37,020
Finally, we provide targeting information.

105
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:41,340
And targeting is key to any application of military force.

106
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:43,240
Every moment of every day,

107
00:06:43,340 --> 00:06:45,940
intelligence information is analyzed at CENTCOM

108
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:48,240
in Doha and in Florida.

109
00:06:48,340 --> 00:06:51,780
Anything that emits a signal, be it friendly or enemy,

110
00:06:51,781 --> 00:06:53,780
