00:06:56,781 --> 00:07:01,780
We do those every day and we collaborate with DIA, CIA,

113
00:07:01,781 --> 00:07:03,780
and also our subordinate commands.

114
00:07:03,781 --> 00:07:07,780
To your top right is a tool called Top Scene.

115
00:07:07,781 --> 00:07:10,780
We manipulate the imagery so that it appears

116
00:07:10,781 --> 00:07:12,780
