00:07:15,781 --> 00:07:18,780
in our forward headquarters in Gutter.

119
00:07:18,781 --> 00:07:21,780
You also see between them there's a phone called

120
00:07:21,781 --> 00:07:25,780
the Internet phone, IP phone, and it allows secure

