122
00:07:28,021 --> 00:07:32,280
Again, a good collaborative tool.

123
00:07:32,281 --> 00:07:34,020
Today's command posts are actually

124
00:07:34,021 --> 00:07:37,120
communications hubs, technologically unparalleled

125
00:07:37,121 --> 00:07:40,280
and able to gather information from anywhere, send it to

126
00:07:40,281 --> 00:07:44,440
anywhere, and do it securely and in real time.

127
00:07:44,441 --> 00:07:49,620
The technology really allows you to get inside the enemy's

