00:07:55,061 --> 00:07:58,860
about the battlefield and the battle space that's over it.

131
00:07:58,861 --> 00:08:00,860
And we know it sooner and quicker,

132
00:08:00,861 --> 00:08:03,760
and therefore we're able to make decisions on that quicker.

133
00:08:03,761 --> 00:08:07,080
So this process needs to happen very quickly

