172
00:10:21,101 --> 00:10:24,900
But because CENTCOM's AOR is the hotspot, it frequently

173
00:10:24,901 --> 00:10:28,820
implements the latest technology first, enabling commanders like

174
00:10:28,821 --> 00:10:32,520
Avaizade to literally conduct a war from thousands of miles away

175
00:10:32,521 --> 00:10:36,020
if they need to. The commander now has the

176
00:10:36,021 --> 00:10:40,660
ability to choose his location rather than being dictated by

