00:11:23,221 --> 00:11:27,060
of every commander's arsenal. CDHQ, this is Tampa.

189
00:11:27,061 --> 00:11:29,660
Today, it continues to provide a tactical advantage

190
00:11:29,661 --> 00:11:32,860
to command posts like CENTCOM, just as it has

191
00:11:32,861 --> 00:11:35,820
since the very first command post ever gathered information

