00:12:01,981 --> 00:12:04,580
lead them himself. Now, he didn't have to report back

201
00:12:04,581 --> 00:12:08,020
to himself because he's already in the field.

202
00:12:08,021 --> 00:12:12,020
But often, word had to be sent from one commander to another,

203
00:12:12,021 --> 00:12:16,020
or to his troops, usually over a battlefield.

204
00:12:16,021 --> 00:12:19,020
Sometimes flags and musical instruments were used to convey

