208
00:12:31,021 --> 00:12:34,020
Some of the earliest forms of communications included horns,

209
00:12:34,021 --> 00:12:37,020
bugles, conch shells, and drums. The bugle, for instance,

210
00:12:37,021 --> 00:12:41,020
The bugle, for instance, was used to give tactical signals

211
00:12:41,021 --> 00:12:42,060
on the battlefield.

212
00:12:42,061 --> 00:12:45,520
A certain series of notes would mean certain things

213
00:12:45,521 --> 00:12:46,520
