214
00:12:46,521 --> 00:12:48,400
And the noise of the bugle could carry

215
00:12:48,401 --> 00:12:49,700
above the den of battle.

216
00:12:49,701 --> 00:12:52,240
Troops could hear it and react accordingly.

217
00:12:52,241 --> 00:12:55,100
To the actual soldier in combat, the flag

218
00:12:55,101 --> 00:12:58,700
