00:13:16,581 --> 00:13:19,320
That type of signal can be of the 1F by land,

227
00:13:19,321 --> 00:13:21,680
2F by sea. It will just tell you that

228
00:13:21,681 --> 00:13:24,820
there's been an invasion. It has to be a prearranged

229
00:13:24,821 --> 00:13:28,460
signal. The Romans improved

