00:13:53,201 --> 00:13:56,800
things out alphabetically. But most intelligence from

238
00:13:56,801 --> 00:13:59,800
ancient battlefields and commanders required transporting

239
00:13:59,801 --> 00:14:03,600
a physical thing, using a messenger to verbally relay the

240
00:14:03,601 --> 00:14:07,200
relay the message or hand over the tablet.

